      "reason": "The current decision treats grain, smudging and softened outlines as sufficient evidence of the entire transformation. The edit visibly introduces chalk-like strokes and shading, but the giraffes retain detailed photographic surface modeling. Split chalk-medium appearance from image-wide drawn representation so texture alone cannot establish completion. The transport failure provides no visual evidence.",
