              "id": "d1_chalk_medium",
              "requirement_id": "R1",
              "question": "Does the edited image use visually convincing chalk mark-making for its outlines and shading?",
              "criteria": "Pass if the edited image visibly uses powdery, broken or textured chalk-like strokes, rubbed shading and chalk-like contours as its rendering medium. Fail if it lacks convincing chalk mark-making, including when ordinary blur or uniform grain is the only effect. Color is permitted; neither monochrome nor a blackboard background is required. Return unknown only when the images are unavailable or insufficient to judge.",
              "binding": "Compare the input and edited images for the requested chalk-drawing appearance, inspecting marks and shading on the giraffes, vegetation and ground."
            },
            {
              "id": "d1_drawn_representation",
              "requirement_id": "R1",
              "question": "Are the scene's subjects and surroundings rendered as drawn forms rather than photographic forms beneath a surface effect?",
              "criteria": "Pass if the principal subjects and surrounding scene are consistently represented through drawn contours, marks and shading, so the image reads as a drawing rather than a photograph with an added texture. Fail if substantial regions retain photographic surface detail or tonal modeling beneath chalk-like grain or smudging. Recognizable anatomy, fine drawn detail and retained colors do not themselves constitute failure. Return unknown only when the images are unavailable or insufficient to judge.",
              "binding": "Compare the input and edited images for the requested transformation into a chalk-made drawing, examining the giraffes' bodies and markings as well as the vegetation, ground and background."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
